{"audio": "2john-01.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 93067, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 933, "text": "2 John."}, {"start_ms": 933, "end_ms": 13867, "text": "The elder unto the elect lady and her children, whom I love in the truth; and not I only, but also all they that have known the truth; For the truth's sake, which dwelleth in us, and shall be with us for ever."}, {"start_ms": 13867, "end_ms": 20933, "text": "Grace be with you, mercy, and peace, from God the Father, and from the Lord Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, in truth and love."}, {"start_ms": 20933, "end_ms": 27467, "text": "I rejoiced greatly that I found of thy children walking in truth, as we have received a commandment from the Father."}, {"start_ms": 27467, "end_ms": 35200, "text": "And now I beseech thee, lady, not as though I wrote a new commandment unto thee, but that which we had from the beginning, that we love one another."}, {"start_ms": 35200, "end_ms": 38933, "text": "And this is love, that we walk after his commandments."}, {"start_ms": 38933, "end_ms": 43600, "text": "This is the commandment, That, as ye have heard from the beginning, ye should walk in it."}, {"start_ms": 43600, "end_ms": 50133, "text": "For many deceivers are entered into the world, who confess not that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh."}, {"start_ms": 50133, "end_ms": 53467, "text": "This is a deceiver and an antichrist."}, {"start_ms": 53467, "end_ms": 59600, "text": "Look to yourselves, that we lose not those things which we have wrought, but that we receive a full reward."}, {"start_ms": 59600, "end_ms": 65200, "text": "Whosoever transgresseth, and abideth not in the doctrine of Christ, hath not God."}, {"start_ms": 65200, "end_ms": 70133, "text": "He that abideth in the doctrine of Christ, he hath both the Father and the Son."}, {"start_ms": 70133, "end_ms": 80533, "text": "If there come any unto you, and bring not this doctrine, receive him not into your house, neither bid him God speed: For he that biddeth him God speed is partaker of his evil deeds."}, {"start_ms": 80533, "end_ms": 89467, "text": "Having many things to write unto you, I would not write with paper and ink: but I trust to come unto you, and speak face to face, that our joy may be full."}, {"start_ms": 89467, "end_ms": 92267, "text": "The children of thy elect sister greet thee."}, {"start_ms": 92267, "end_ms": 93067, "text": "Amen."}], "words": [{"t": "2", "s": 0, "e": 649, "si": 0}, {"t": "John.", "s": 649, "e": 892, "si": 0}, {"t": "The", "s": 1574, "e": 1654, "si": 1}, {"t": "elder", "s": 1814, "e": 2114, "si": 1}, {"t": "unto", "s": 2314, "e": 2495, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 2535, "e": 2615, "si": 1}, {"t": "elect", "s": 2655, "e": 2935, "si": 1}, {"t": "lady", "s": 2975, "e": 3235, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 3436, "e": 3556, "si": 1}, {"t": "her", "s": 3596, "e": 3716, "si": 1}, {"t": "children,", "s": 3756, "e": 4197, "si": 1}, {"t": "whom", "s": 4317, "e": 4497, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 4597, "e": 4617, "si": 1}, {"t": "love", "s": 4697, "e": 4937, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 4957, "e": 5017, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 5057, "e": 5138, "si": 1}, {"t": "truth;", "s": 5178, "e": 5538, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 6199, "e": 6299, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 6339, "e": 6499, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 6639, "e": 6659, "si": 1}, {"t": "only,", "s": 6739, "e": 6980, "si": 1}, {"t": "but", "s": 7200, "e": 7300, "si": 1}, {"t": "also", "s": 7360, "e": 7620, "si": 1}, {"t": "all", "s": 7860, "e": 8041, "si": 1}, {"t": "they", "s": 8101, "e": 8301, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 8381, "e": 8521, "si": 1}, {"t": "have", "s": 8561, "e": 8681, "si": 1}, {"t": "known", "s": 8701, "e": 8922, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 8962, "e": 9042, "si": 1}, {"t": "truth;", "s": 9102, "e": 9422, "si": 1}, {"t": "For", "s": 9923, "e": 10023, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 10063, "e": 10143, "si": 1}, {"t": "truth's", "s": 10203, "e": 10523, "si": 1}, {"t": "sake,", "s": 10583, "e": 10864, "si": 1}, {"t": "whic